# ABP String Encryption

## Using IStringEncryptionService
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly IStringEncryptionService _encryptionService;

    public string EncryptData(string plainText)
    {
        return _encryptionService.Encrypt(plainText);
    }

    public string DecryptData(string cipherText)
    {
        return _encryptionService.Decrypt(cipherText);
    }
}
```

## Configuration
```csharp
Configure<AbpStringEncryptionOptions>(options =>
{
    options.DefaultPassPhrase = "YourSecretPassPhrase";
});
```

Used by settings system for encrypted settings (`isEncrypted: true`).
